WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:06.666
"Help!" Ringo fell through glitter clouds.

2
00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:09.607
"Ringo!" Lucy yelled.

3
00:00:09.608 --> 00:00:11.725
She looked around.

4
00:00:11.726 --> 00:00:17.967
An emergency jet pack hung nearby.

5
00:00:17.968 --> 00:00:20.441
Lucy strapped it on.

6
00:00:20.442 --> 00:00:25.015
Bzzt! Bzzt! Sparks and glitter shot from it.

7
00:00:25.016 --> 00:00:29.010
"Grr!" Lucy shook the jet pack.

8
00:00:29.011 --> 00:00:33.504
Finally it turned on.

9
00:00:33.505 --> 00:00:41.777
Lucy shot down to Ringo. Whoosh!

10
00:00:41.778 --> 00:00:43.813
She grabbed him.

11
00:00:43.814 --> 00:00:50.801
"Hang on, Tiny!"

12
00:00:50.802 --> 00:00:53.505
Lucy flew back up.

13
00:00:53.506 --> 00:00:57.098
"We're almost there," she said.

14
00:00:57.099 --> 00:00:59.151
Bzzt! Bzzt!

15
00:00:59.152 --> 00:01:02.005
The jet pack died.

16
00:01:02.006 --> 00:01:05.463
"Oh no!" Ringo cried.

17
00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:08.493
Lucy threw her hand up.

18
00:01:08.494 --> 00:01:11.985
She grabbed the ship's railing.

19
00:01:11.986 --> 00:01:14.989
"Err!" Lucy said.

20
00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:19.002
She pulled hard . . .

21
00:01:19.003 --> 00:01:23.267
They made it onto the deck!

22
00:01:23.268 --> 00:01:29.711
Ringo grinned. "I'm glad you're so strong!"

23
00:01:29.712 --> 00:01:32.716
"Me too," Lucy said.

24
00:01:32.717 --> 00:01:41.118
Suddenly the ship leaned forward.

25
00:01:41.119 --> 00:01:45.929
"What's happening?" one passenger cried.

26
00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:52.527
"This vacation stinks!" another said.

27
00:01:52.528 --> 00:01:55.501
"Don't worry," Ringo said.

28
00:01:55.502 --> 00:01:58.594
"We're from Space Patrol."

29
00:01:58.595 --> 00:02:02.985
Lucy nodded. "We'll find out what's wrong."

30
00:02:02.986 --> 00:02:04.996
Passengers cheered.

31
00:02:04.997 --> 00:02:17.083
"Hooray for Space Patrol!"

32
00:02:17.084 --> 00:02:21.945
Ringo and Lucy found the control deck.

33
00:02:21.946 --> 00:02:28.509
Glitter filled the air.

34
00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:31.974
A robot lay near the controls.

35
00:02:31.975 --> 00:02:37.353
Ringo gulped. "That must be the pilot!"

36
00:02:37.354 --> 00:02:45.320
Lucy gulped. "Nobody's flying the ship!"

